\label{tab:probe}
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{4pt}
\small
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{3pt}
\begin{tabular}{lcccc}
\toprule
Suite & Pre-action AUC & Depth & Shuffled & Length-only \\
\midrule
Obstacle avoid.\      & \textbf{0.940} & 61\% & 0.626 & 0.500 \\
Obstacle+hand         & \textbf{0.998} & 22\% & 0.527 & 0.500 \\
Human safety          & 0.988 & 44\% & 0.516 & 0.478 \\
